              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova amũkũlya Samueli, Ũkamũĩĩa Saulo kũvika ĩndĩĩ, nakwa nĩnĩmũleete ndakethĩwe mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli? Usũsya ũvya waku mauta, na ũkĩthi: nĩngũũtũma kwa Yese Mũmbethi‐leemu; nũndũ nĩnĩmanthĩe mũsumbĩ ananĩ make. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
