          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ Yeova amwĩa Samueli, Ndũkasisye ũthyũ wake, kana ũtũlu wa kĩũngamo kyake; nĩkwĩthĩwa nyie nĩnĩmũleete: nũndũ Yeova ndasiasya ũndũ mũndũ ũsiasya; nũndũ mũndũ asiasya mũvw’anĩle wa ũtheinĩ, ĩndĩ Yeova asiasya ngoonĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
